["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Edward Said and the question of Palestine Orientalism Oslo Accord West-Eastern Divan Orchestra\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-19-throughline-萨义德把巴勒斯坦问题带进美国主流话语-却从未等到他期望的和解/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4024x4024+0+0/resize/3000/quality/66/format/jpg/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnpr-production-npr.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com%2Fbrightspot%2F02%2F04%2F30b53e8145b4a73e61d296056ad9%2F1c50c67c-46c2-421d-91f3-a194d2396347.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">51:44</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Throughline</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1119</span></div>\n<h2>薩義德把巴勒斯坦問題帶進美國主流話語，卻從未等到他期望的和解</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">薩義德一生試圖用文學與音樂的語言讓西方理解巴勒斯坦人的存在，但他晚年親眼看到奧斯陸協議簽署後殺戮反而更多，並斷定兩國方案已被現實架空。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>3</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">巴以衝突</span><span class=\"tag\">後殖民理論</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Juba II: Rome’s King of Africa client king Euphorbia\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-19-ancients-凯撒把战败敌人的幼子养大-养成了北非最亲罗马的国王/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/118420a97bcb462e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">49:22</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Ancients</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1119</span></div>\n<h2>凱撒把戰敗敵人的幼子養大，養成了北非最親羅馬的國王</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">朱巴二世兩歲時作為戰俘被凱撒牽著遊街，卻被收養進屋大維婭家中長大，最終被奧古斯都扶上毛里塔尼亞王位，統治四十年從未被羅馬懷疑。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">羅馬帝國</span><span class=\"tag\">北非歷史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Hatshepsut: Was This Really Egypt&#x27;s Greatest Pharaoh? regent Opet Festival co-regency\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-19-historyhit-哈特谢普苏特不是女扮男装-她把自己做成了法老/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6426b5c63fd6a864-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">44:51</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">History Hit</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1119</span></div>\n<h2>哈特謝普蘇特不是女扮男裝，她把自己做成了法老</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">她不是偽裝成男人的女王，而是把王權本身的圖像語言——那副假鬍鬚——改寫成「國王」的標誌，用貿易和建築而非戰爭定義了何為偉大的統治者。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">古埃及</span><span class=\"tag\">法老</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"724. The Charge of the Light Brigade: Into The Valley of Death (Part 4) redoubt the thin red line Causeway Heights\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-19-restishistory-轻骑兵冲锋并非愚蠢送死-战术上它其实成功了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/77709224d0619622-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:11:56</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Rest Is History</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1119</span></div>\n<h2>輕騎兵衝鋒並非愚蠢送死：戰術上它其實成功了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">命令含糊、將領失和導致六百輕騎兵衝向三面炮火的死亡谷，但他們真的打垮了俄軍炮兵和騎兵，是戰略上的災難，戰術上的勝利。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">克里米亞戰爭</span><span class=\"tag\">軍事史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"415. Lawrence of Arabia: Rory Stewart vs. William Dalrymple - The Legacy (Part 5) Seven Pillars of Wisdom Sykes-Picot McMahon letters India Office Arab Bulletin\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-19-empirehist-劳伦斯写信痛斥英国在伊拉克撒谎-结果被昔日同僚联手抹黑/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6dcfd4bf69c91d0f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">49:32</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Empire 世界史</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1119</span></div>\n<h2>勞倫斯寫信痛斥英國在伊拉克撒謊，結果被昔日同僚聯手抹黑</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他對伊拉克佔領的憤怒預言了百年後的戰爭現實，但正是這些批評招來印度事務處和外交部的全力抹黑，說他不懂阿拉伯語、沒資格說話。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中東史</span><span class=\"tag\">殖民主義</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"189: Geodesic顧全全：預訓練有點“無聊”了，但用scaling改變AI製藥才剛開始 訓飛 Try2 Scaling Law\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-19-latetalk-预训练的新意正在变少-但把scaling搬进ai制药才刚开始/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ac7d832522d328e5-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"晚\"><span class=\"dur\">1:36:02</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">晚點聊</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1119</span></div>\n<h2>預訓練的新意正在變少，但把Scaling搬進AI製藥才剛開始</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">字節的蛋白質結構設計模型只用2650萬個結構數據就訓出900兆參數模型，而公開結構數據有13億個——算力而不是數據，才是AI製藥現在最大的瓶頸。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI製藥</span><span class=\"tag\">Scaling</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Side Project to $9M Raised, No Co-Founder | Yahia Bakour, Context.dev NRR (Net Revenue Retention) design partner agency\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-18-solofounders-融到900万美元后他说-拿了风投的钱-更应该一个人创业/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ba8972d929c3a758-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">57:34</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">單人創始人</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1118</span></div>\n<h2>融到900萬美元后他說：拿了風投的錢，更應該一個人創業</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他把融資比作婚姻：一旦簽了就是十年，而正因為用的是別人的錢，獨自決策反而讓該轉向、該拒絕的艱難時刻更容易拍板。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">獨立創始人</span><span class=\"tag\">融資</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"What Does It All Mean, Though? trial by combat weregild\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-18-britishhist-罗兰之歌-审判戏其实是给封建公爵们的一记警告/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/fdf8df11ad3c0078-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">19:01</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">British History Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1118</span></div>\n<h2>《羅蘭之歌》審判戲其實是給封建公爵們的一記警告</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">加納隆被馬拉肢解、全家三十名男丁被滅門，這個結局是在為「國王擁有絕對暴力壟斷權」的集權敘事背書，而非單純的復仇故事。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中世紀史</span><span class=\"tag\">封建制度</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"At The Money: Shopping in an Era of Surveillance Capitalism surveillance pricing drip pricing dark patterns loyalty penalty right to repair\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-18-mastersinbiz-忠诚计划的陷阱-你越常买-优惠反而越少/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cce6bb022eede7c0-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">25:21</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Masters in Business</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1118</span></div>\n<h2>忠誠計劃的陷阱：你越常買，優惠反而越少</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">一旦算法確認你是「穩定客戶」，公司不再需要給你折扣，星巴克和麥當勞的用戶數據報告都證明了這一點。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">監控定價</span><span class=\"tag\">消費者權益</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Notion’s Founder on the One Thing Your AI Is Missing vibe coding headless product\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-18-aiandi-notion创始人-ai能给你代码-但不该替你保管-理解/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9bccab920fb419de-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">33:45</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">AI &amp; I（Every）</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1118</span></div>\n<h2>Notion創始人：AI能給你代碼，但不該替你保管「理解」</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Vibe coding讓人人都能做軟件，但Ivan Zhao認為真正耐久的不是UI和過程代碼，而是數據和上下文——誰掌握這個，誰才是AI時代的贏家。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Notion</span><span class=\"tag\">vibe coding</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Software factories and code reviews with Harjot Gill hill climbing software factory polyphasic sleep\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-18-pragmatic-创始人边开特斯拉fsd边指挥ai编码-月提交5000次/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1ee23f2f57f8e42d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:26:37</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">The Pragmatic Engineer</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1118</span></div>\n<h2>創始人邊開特斯拉FSD邊指揮AI編碼，月提交5000次</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">CodeRabbit創始人認為人工代碼評審已死，軟件工程的瓶頸從人才轉向token消耗，小團隊靠驅動AI代理也能做到Facebook級別的發布規模，但代價是鉅額算力和CPU賬單。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI編程</span><span class=\"tag\">軟件工廠</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Do Pigeons Navigate with Their Livers? A New Study Sparks Debate magnetoreception radical pair hypothesis cryptochrome macrophage superparamagnetism authorization vs appropriations\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-18-fromfirstprinc-鸽子用肝脏感知地球磁场-物理学家联手算出根本不可能/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dabc3192df79062a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"F\"><span class=\"dur\">1:40:01</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">From First Principles</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1118</span></div>\n<h2>鴿子用肝臟感知地球磁場？物理學家聯手算出根本不可能</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">這篇登上Science封面的論文稱鴿子靠肝臟巨噬細胞在陰天導航，三位磁感應領域的元老級學者聯手計算後反駁：該機制在體溫下熱噪聲比磁場信號大30倍，物理上站不住腳。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">磁感應</span><span class=\"tag\">鴿子導航</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"First observation of a giant star swallowing its neighbour common envelope phase/evolution dynamical friction quantum entanglement Bell test no-cloning\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-18-naturepod-恒星直接吞噬伴星首次被观测到-结局是合并爆炸而非幸存双星/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9b247947db171866-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">24:32</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Nature Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1118</span></div>\n<h2>恆星直接吞噬伴星首次被觀測到，結局是合併爆炸而非倖存雙星</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">天文學家在仙女座星系捕捉到一顆巨星七年緩慢變亮後突然爆發到百萬倍太陽亮度，證據顯示伴星沒能逃脫，而是被拖入核心合併，而非常見理論裡設想的「甩掉外殼、雙星倖存」。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">天體物理</span><span class=\"tag\">雙星演化</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"How To Build The Future: Eric Glyman, Co-CEO of Ramp Jevons paradox Coase&#x27;s theorem AI harness MCP\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-18-ycsp-ramp-内部不招人一个季度-只为逼团队学会用-ai/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c6301d17041505af-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"Y\"><span class=\"dur\">54:18</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Y Combinator</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1118</span></div>\n<h2>Ramp 內部不招人一個季度，只為逼團隊學會用 AI</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Ramp 發現工程師用 AI 後生產力達到 100 倍，但銷售、設計跟不上就會拖垮組織，於是乾脆暫停整季招聘，強迫所有人把 AI 變成核心能力而非附加技能。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">企業軟件</span><span class=\"tag\">AI agent</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Louise Michel, Anarchist Paris Commune Kanak\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-18-stuffmissed-审判席上她不求宽恕-只要求与同志们一起受罚/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">43:31</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1118</span></div>\n<h2>審判席上她不求寬恕，只要求與同志們一起受罰</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">法國政府以為流放和監禁能馴服她，結果路易絲·米歇爾在法庭上拒絕自辯，公開承認參與巴黎公社的一切行動並要求判處死刑。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">人物傳記</span><span class=\"tag\">法國歷史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Missing Layer for Personal AI | First Person Labs’ Ken Liu confidential inference zero data retention Second Local reflective productivity\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-18-a16z-ai给你建一个-第二人格-连创始人都看不到你的那份/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">33:57</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1118</span></div>\n<h2>AI給你建一個「第二人格」，連創始人都看不到你的那份</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">First Person Labs把數據和推理拆開：本地或機密計算裡跑模型，公司自己也證明不了能看到你的內容，信任靠硬件而不是承諾。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">個人AI</span><span class=\"tag\">機密計算</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"How GTA VI Became the Most Expensive Video Game Ever Made performance capture microtransactions stranger encounters\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-18-oddlots-gta6烧掉十几亿美元-但制作人说这是个例-不是行业范本/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">50:52</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1118</span></div>\n<h2>GTA6燒掉十幾億美元，但製作人說這是個例，不是行業範本</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Rockstar靠GTA系列的確定性才敢把預算花到十幾億美元，而行業其他公司正因為銷量沒跟上預算增長而被迫削減開支，GTA6無法被複制。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">遊戲行業</span><span class=\"tag\">GTA6</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Vol.292｜施展×劉擎：從陰山互市到上海口岸，碰撞中的秩序生成 impersonal plus game\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-18-cn27f438-明朝打不过蒙古就开放互市-战争立刻消失了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7d46bbafb24c11f4-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"東\"><span class=\"dur\">35:33</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">東腔西調</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1118</span></div>\n<h2>明朝打不過蒙古就開放互市，戰爭立刻消失了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">嘉靖朝南倭北虜打得筋疲力盡，換了皇帝開放互市和海禁，戰爭就沒了——貿易不是零和博弈，規則常常是在衝突耗盡雙方之後、在交往界面上長出來的。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">制度史</span><span class=\"tag\">上海</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Indigenous Entomology (BUGS &amp; TRADITIONAL ECOLOGICAL KNOWLEDGE) with Cheyenne Reuben-Thomas cultural fire Three Sisters traditional ecological knowledge (TEK)\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-18-ologies-入侵物种也在-干自己的活-原住民生态知识不用好坏二分法/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6714d8dbd3a57d1f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">1:01:57</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Ologies</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1118</span></div>\n<h2>入侵物種也在&quot;幹自己的活&quot;:原住民生態知識不用好壞二分法</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">歐洲蜜蜂、亞洲瓢蟲這類常被叫作「入侵種」的生物，在原住民生態知識裡被看作在履行各自的生態職責，而不是非黑即白的敵人。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">昆蟲學</span><span class=\"tag\">原住民知識</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"BI 250 Nima Dehghani: How Brains Compute computational closure functor divisive normalization winner-take-all wave walker / pilot wave\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-18-braininspired-ai-的-智能体-说法是误称-自主性要靠计算闭合-不是算力堆出来的/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a9d77f3058f9aa91-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"B\"><span class=\"dur\">1:47:54</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Brain Inspired</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1118</span></div>\n<h2>AI 的「智能體」說法是誤稱：自主性要靠計算閉合，不是算力堆出來的</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">判斷一個系統有沒有自主性，不是看它能不能做圖靈完備的運算，而是看它的內部迴路能不能自己閉合——這正是現在所謂AI agent名不副實的地方。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">神經科學</span><span class=\"tag\">計算理論</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"157. 復盤Personal Agent集體誕生背後：和蔡偉聊AI產品史、需求真偽、入口與未來想像 harness MCP A2A\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-18-zhangxiaojun-个人助理的竞争短期看模型-中长期拼的是供给和安全信任/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7c56751483666a88-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">2:43:40</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1118</span></div>\n<h2>個人助理的競爭短期看模型，中長期拼的是供給和安全信任</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">蔡偉判斷模型能力早晚會進入穩態、各家大差不差，屆時真正拉開差距的是誰手握更多線下供給、誰的安全合規做得足夠深。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Personal Agent</span><span class=\"tag\">AI產品策略</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"對話 Google Cloud FDE 負責人王書元：FDE落到企業上，第一步是造“樣板間” FDE brain in a vat FDE BP nano banana self-distillation\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-18-guijilichang-别急着买工具-企业ai落地的第一步是造一个能跑通的样板间/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/38d8d27c2f34d3c1-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"硅\"><span class=\"dur\">1:09:11</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">硅基立場</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1118</span></div>\n<h2>別急著買工具，企業AI落地的第一步是造一個能跑通的樣板間</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">王書元說，AI不像數據庫這類舊技術升級——每個人對AI都有自己的理解，靠集思廣益很難推進，企業應該先在一個部門做出能閉環的樣板，再靠示範效應說服全公司跟進。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">FDE</span><span class=\"tag\">企業AI落地</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Are We Addicted to Control? with Dr Anna Lembke infinite flexibility mental map / mental model\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-18-iq2-你的焦虑不是缺乏控制-而是控制过了头/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e254f7f220660b07-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">40:06</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Intelligence Squared</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1118</span></div>\n<h2>你的焦慮不是缺乏控制，而是控制過了頭</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Lembke 認為現代人的恐懼、孤獨和羞恥感根源於「無限可塑性」的幻覺——以為自己能掌控一切，結果一旦失控就只剩自責，而真正的解藥是向自己之外的更高力量交出意志。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">心理健康</span><span class=\"tag\">自戀</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"414. Lawrence of Arabia: Palestine, Iraq, &amp; The Motorcycle Crash (Part 4)\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-18-empirehist-劳伦斯空手赴巴黎和会-犹太代表团却带着水权地图谈妥一切/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6dcfd4bf69c91d0f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">57:40</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Empire 世界史</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1118</span></div>\n<h2>勞倫斯空手赴巴黎和會，猶太代表團卻帶著水權地圖談妥一切</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1919年巴黎和會上，阿拉伯代表團遲到、無文件、無策略，而猶太復國主義代表團已遊說六週並備好詳細的水權與移民方案，這場較量從一開始就不對等。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中東史</span><span class=\"tag\">巴以衝突</span>\n</div></div></a>"]